,[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwim-43dwdKWAxWagq8BHVKlNl4Q3YcHCJIBKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwim-43dwdKWAxWagq8BHVKlNl4Q3IcHCJEBKBI",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["在網路上偶然搜尋到的龍蝦拉麵非常吸引我，於是就開了來回50多公里的車過來，幸好上班日後面巷子停車格非常多位子又便宜。\n\n1.環境\n位置在捷運站正一樓，非常好的位子，大馬路邊也不難找，裡面裝潢很好，簡介裡也有屋子從無到有的裝修過程，顯見老闆投入很多心血也很用心。\n\n2.龍蝦拉麵（$378）\n奔著這個來的，當然就直接點了。另外加$88就有套餐：可以選各種飲料、蝦茶碗蒸或者是冰淇淋一球。我選了可爾必思跟茶碗蒸，非常推薦茶碗蒸，料多而且口感非常好，相片看不出來，地下很多料呢。\n期待的拉麵來了，可惜龍蝦（小青龍）只有半隻呀，我記得上次看評論是整整一隻，難道漲價了？分兩口就吃完了，味道相當不錯；拉麵的配料也相當豐富，除了一般的蝦子🦐、小魚乾、三片大叉燒片外、居然還有一顆大干貝！真是驚喜。\n\n小缺點是湯頭跟拉麵屬於台式的風味，不是正宗日式的是有點可惜，拉麵類似面框框的那種麵缺乏嚼勁（我點的是最硬的），湯頭有蛋黃金莎的味道，缺乏日式的鮮甜是有點可惜，當然為了配合本地口味也無可厚非吧。\n\n整體而言，3.7分，算是中上的評價。（龍蝦物美價廉很好吃加分不少😋）",null,[0,64]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzVUdGcVVsUk9NbWN5WVhwc2NtVnVSbWhXUlRseFRGVTVXazlIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzVUdGcVVsUk9NbWN5WVhwc2NtVnVSbWhXUlRseFRGVTVXazlIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzVUdGcVVsUk9NbWN5WVhwc2NtVnVSbWhXUlRseFRGVTVXazlIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzVUdGcVVsUk9NbWN5WVhwc2NtVnVSbWhXUlRseFRGVTVXazlIWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzVUdGcVVsUk9NbWN5WVhwc2NtVnVSbWhXUlRseFRGVTVXazlIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzVUdGcVVsUk9NbWN5WVhwc2NtVnVSbWhXUlRseFRGVTVXazlIWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,11982,["https://w